---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '>Q： 我';
const description = '为游客提供完整的中国海关指南——免税限额、违禁物品、申报内容和选择渠道。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/visa/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Visa & Entry
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛂 入境和签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China Customs Regulations: What You Can and Cannot Bring into China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">为进入中国的游客提供海关规则实用指南。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>忘记谷歌和脸书吧——这是你真正需要的。</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Here's the short version for a typical tourist:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-blue-600 text-white">
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left">✅ 很好带</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left">⚠️ 查看以下详细信息</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left">❌ 不要带</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-4 py-2">衣服、洗漱用品、手机、笔记本电脑、相机</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">酒精、香烟、贵重礼品&gt；2000元，现金&gt； $5,000</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">肉、水果、蔬菜、毒品、武器</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-blue-800 text-sm space-y-1">
        <li><strong>留在中国的礼品/消耗品：</strong> keep under <strong>2000元人民币</strong></li>
        <li><strong>香烟：</strong> max <strong>400</strong> (200 if from HK/Macau)</li>
        <li><strong>酒精：</strong> up to <strong>1.5升</strong> (0.75L if from HK/Macau)</li>
        <li><strong>外币现金：</strong> declare if over <strong>5000美元</strong></li>
        <li><strong>人民币现金：</strong> max <strong>20000元</strong> (no exceptions)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">❌ 不要把这些带到中国</h2>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">不可转让（将被没收）：</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li>🚫 毒品、武器、假冒商品</li>
          <li>🚫 新鲜水果、蔬菜、生肉、鸡蛋、乳制品、活植物</li>
          <li>🚫 濒危物种产品（象牙、虎骨、犀牛角）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">注意这些惊喜：</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>肉类零食</strong> (beef jerky, sausages, bacon) — also banned, even if packaged</li>
          <li><strong>你忘在包里的水果</strong> — the quarantine beagles will find it</li>
          <li><strong>中医</strong> — some contain endangered species. Stick to packaged ones with clear labels</li>
          <li><strong>充电宝</strong> — must have a 3C mark, carry-on only, max 160Wh</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">💰 大多数游客需要知道的</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">你留下的礼物和东西</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The 2,000 RMB allowance applies to items you give away or consume in China (gifts, souvenirs you hand to a friend, chocolate you eat during your stay). Items you brought for yourself and take home don't count.
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold">你是。..</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold">留在中国的物品免税额</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">外国游客</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3"><strong>2,000 RMB</strong></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold">中国居民回国</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">5000元人民币</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">香烟和酒精</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The customs declaration form sets these duty-free limits. If you exceed them, check the box and use the Red Channel.
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold">Item</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center">入境旅客</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center">香港/澳门入境人数</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">香烟（包括加热烟草）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center"><strong>400</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">200</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Cigars</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center"><strong>20</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">10</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">散叶</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center"><strong>500克</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">250克</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">电子烟装置</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center"><strong>2</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">电子烟盒</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center"><strong>6</strong> (≤ 12 ml total liquid)</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">3（≤6毫升）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">酒精（≥12%）</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center"><strong>1500毫升</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">750毫升</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">注：对于经常出入境的人（每天/每周过境），适用更严格的限制——40支香烟、2支雪茄、40克烟草、1个电子烟设备。大多数游客不属于这一类。</p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Cash</h3>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold">Currency</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center">Limit</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold">该怎么办</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">人民币</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">Max <strong>20,000 yuan</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">超过此=禁止</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3">美元或其他外币</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">Declare if <strong>超过5000美元</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">拿一张盖章的表格，留着准备出发</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Medication</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>处方药：</strong> 7-day supply is fine without paperwork. For longer stays, bring a doctor's note. Keep pills in original bottles — customs officers don't trust pill organizers.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <strong>感冒药警告：</strong> Medicines containing <strong>伪麻黄碱</strong> (Sudafed, NyQuil, many generic cold tablets) are restricted in China. One box is fine; bringing several boxes can be treated as carrying drug precursors. Don't overpack cold meds.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">你会带回家的电子产品</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
        Your laptop, phone, camera, and tablet are fine in the Green Channel — they're personal items you brought and will take home. If you're carrying very expensive gear (pro camera rig, multiple laptops), you can voluntarily declare them as "temporary imports" at the Red Channel to avoid departure questions, but most tourists don't bother and have no issues.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">🚦 选择哪个频道</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        The customs declaration form has 7 boxes. <strong>如果适用于您→ 红色频道。如果没有适用→ 绿色通道。</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center">#</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold">如果您携带，请勾选此框。..</th>
              <th class="px-5 py-3 font-bold text-center">首选</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">1</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">动物、植物、新鲜食品、肉类、微生物、生物制品</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">2</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">（中国居民回国）5000元以上物品</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">3</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">(Foreign tourist) Gifts or items <strong>价值超过2000元人民币</strong> being <strong>留在中国</strong></td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">4</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Over <strong>1,500 ml</strong> alcohol / <strong>400</strong> cigarettes / <strong>20</strong> cigars / <strong>500 g</strong> tobacco / over 2 e-cigarette devices or 6 pods</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">5</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">Over <strong>20000元人民币</strong> cash or <strong>$5,000 USD</strong> foreign cash</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">6</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">单独装运行李、商务货物</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center font-bold">7</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3">还有什么你不确定的吗</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-3 text-center">🔴</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-8">没有勾选复选框？ → 🟢 绿色通道。只需步行即可。</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">真实旅游场景</h2>

      <!-- Scenario 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-4 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">场景1：你给中国朋友带礼物</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">你打包了一瓶单一麦芽苏格兰威士忌（150美元）、一盒手工巧克力（40美元）和一个品牌皮夹（120美元）——所有这些礼物都是送给你在上海的朋友的。总价值：约310美元（约2200元人民币）。</p>
        <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-yellow-900"><strong>分析：</strong> These items are staying in China (gifts) and exceed 2,000 RMB total. On the form, box 3 is checked.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-red-700 font-semibold mt-1">→ 🔴 红色频道。将其申报为“留在中国的礼物”，并准备支付超过200元人民币的关税。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scenario 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-4 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">场景2：你带了5500美元现金</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">您在旅行前兑换了现金，钱包里有5500美元可用于旅行。</p>
        <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-yellow-900"><strong>Analysis:</strong> Foreign cash over $5,000 USD triggers box 5.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-red-700 font-semibold mt-1">→ 🔴 红色频道。申报5500美元，填写现金申报表，并获得盖章副本。请保留该表格，以便在您离开时将剩余现金退回。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scenario 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-4 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">场景3：只是一个普通的旅行行李</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">你打包了衣服、洗漱用品、笔记本电脑、手机、Kindle和相机——所有你要带回家的个人物品。总价值数千美元，但没有一家留在中国。</p>
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-green-800"><strong>Analysis:</strong> No box on the form applies. These are "temporary imports" — personal belongings you'll take home.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-green-700 font-semibold mt-1">→ 🟢 绿色通道。95%的游客都是这样。走过去。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scenario 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-4 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">场景4：你为旅行打包了感冒药</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">你有一盒感冒和流感药片（含伪麻黄碱）、一些抗过敏药和一小管抗生素乳膏——这是任何旅行者的标准品。</p>
        <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-yellow-900"><strong>Analysis:</strong> Regular OTC meds for personal use are fine. Pseudoephedrine is restricted in China, but a single box (7-day supply) is usually not an issue.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-green-700 font-semibold mt-1">→ 🟢 绿色通道为正常数量。但如果你带了几个盒子，情况就不同了。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scenario 5 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-4 not-prose">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">场景5：飞机上的一个苹果和一个鸡肉三明治</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">你从早餐服务中抓起一个新鲜的苹果和一个三明治，却忘了它们在你的背包里。</p>
        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-red-800"><strong>Analysis:</strong> Fresh fruit = box 1. Meat products = box 1.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-red-700 font-semibold mt-1">→ 🔴 红色频道。宣布它们——它们将被没收并销毁。在选择频道之前，一定要检查你的包。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-red-900 text-sm"><strong>如有疑问，请选择红色频道。</strong> Voluntary declaration is a minor form. Hiding things gets them confiscated and you fined.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📝 如何申报</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <strong>在海关领取纸质表格</strong> — grab a "Declaration Form for Baggage" (中英文对照, available at the counter before the inspection channels) and fill it out on the spot. Tick any box that applies, then hand it to the officer at the Red Channel.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <strong>隐瞒事情的处罚：</strong> Confiscation + fines up to 100,000 RMB. Tax evasion over 10,000 RMB can lead to criminal charges.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">💡 快速提示</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>将药物装入原装瓶中</strong> — customs officers don't trust pill organizers</li>
        <li><strong>你的包里没有水果、肉或奶制品</strong> — quarantine beagles are very good at their job</li>
        <li><strong>海关禁止拍照</strong> — recording is prohibited in inspection areas</li>
        <li><strong>在选择频道之前检查你的包</strong> — that apple from the flight counts</li>
        <li><strong>保留收据</strong> for branded goods and gifts</li>
      </ol>

    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📚 来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="http://english.customs.gov.cn/Statics/88707c1e-aa4e-40ca-a968-bdbdbb565e4f.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国海关官员--旅客行李申报</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-6">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完成出发前检查表</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/arrival-card/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何在线提交您的入境卡</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">带截图的分步指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
